нса.", "new_answer_fr": "Il est conseillé de rejoindre une alliance en priorité car cela donne +20% à la production de niobium, d'eau et de rations sur toutes vos planètes, ainsi que l'accès aux recherches d'alliance. Ce bonus s'appelle le bonus d'alliance.", "kind": "multi_section", "note": ""}
{"id": "q165", "pooled": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "buildings", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "buildings", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "ship_types", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "planet_management", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 1}], "relevant": [{"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Se após o balanço diário seu saldo de Bitcoins ficar negativo, ocorre o Game Over econômico: todas as suas frotas são suprimidas (em voo e em órbita, com carga e tropas a bordo), todas as naves em solo dos seus planetas são perdidas e seu saldo volta para 125.000 Bitcoins. Você mantém seus planetas, edifícios, defesas, pesquisas e as tropas que ficaram em solo.", "new_answer_fr": "Si après le bilan quotidien votre solde de Bitcoins devient négatif, c'est le Game Over économique : toutes vos flottes sont supprimées (en vol et en orbite, avec cargaison et troupes à bord), tous les vaisseaux au sol de vos planètes sont perdus et votre solde revient à 125 000 Bitcoins. Vous conservez vos planètes, bâtiments, défenses, recherches et les troupes restées au sol.", "kind": "multi_section", "note": "La réponse est identique dans les sections S8 et S24, aucune modification nécessaire."}
{"id": "q180", "pooled": [{"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "buildings", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "fleet_creation", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "espionage", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "defense", "section_index": 9}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "planet_types", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "planet_types", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "planet_management", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "heroes", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "items", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "game_modes", "section_index": 6}], "relevant": [{"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 1}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "O ciclo de produção de uma lua é de 1 minuto, em vez de 10 minutos como em um planeta.", "new_answer_fr": "Le cycle de production d'une lune est de 1 minute, au lieu de 10 minutes comme sur une planète.", "kind": "factual", "note": ""}
{"id": "q187", "pooled": [{"slug": "first_fleet", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "fleet_creation", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "ship_types", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "fleet_missions", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "fleet_management", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "raid", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "raid", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "combat_stats", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "battle_reports", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "planet_types", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "planet_abandon", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "quests", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "secondary_heroes", "section_index": 8}, {"slug": "items", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "arena", "section_index": 4}], "relevant": [{"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "ship_types", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "fleet_missions", "section_index": 1}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Send recyclers to the battle location. A fleet with at least one recycler and room in its hold automatically starts recycling as soon as it arrives on the debris field, whatever its mission. Add cargo ships to the fleet because a recycler alone only carries 1,000 resources.", "new_answer_fr": "Envoyez des recycleurs sur le lieu de la bataille. Une flotte avec au moins un recycleur et de la place en soute commence automatiquement à recycler dès son arrivée sur le champ de débris, quelle que soit sa mission. Ajoutez des cargos à la flotte car un recycleur seul n'emporte que 1 000 ressources.", "kind": "procedural", "note": ""}
